Contributions

You may fork this repository and change your copy for the sole purpose of
proposing those changes back to it as a pull request, and you may run your
copy locally while you do so. Publishing or distributing a copy, modified
or not, anywhere, including addon sites, is not permitted, except as set
out under Inactive project below.

By submitting a contribution you grant the copyright holder a perpetual,
worldwide, irrevocable licence to use, modify, relicense and distribute it
as part of this project.
You still own the code you contribute and may use it in your own work as
well. This project keeps the rights granted above.

Inactive project

If no new version has been released for 6 months, anyone may open an issue
asking whether the project is still maintained. If the maintainer has not
answered within 30 days, anyone may publish a non-commercial fork under a
name that does not include "ClassicUI Forever", crediting this project.
